vb+='<p>Strata overlap and must not be summed. Preserved automated findings were the weak stratum; corrections address observed errors without certifying the unsampled records. Hits include the four sampled MCP ownership records and Paygent Connect/iPayX appropriately unresolved at that historical checkpoint. Misses include GitHub and GoHighLevel auth labels, HubSpot CLI-token/UI-permission contamination, and Salesforce product-blog breadth. Amazon needed a listing-policy caveat; Gumroad/fanbasis unknowns were recoverable evidence gaps.</p>'
